      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Software for LiteX SoCs",
      "source_hash": 7427255106745429402,
      "context_hash": 2072557012984330713,
      "translation": "LiteX SoC용 소프트웨어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:31.785523Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This directory contains libraries and software packages for LiteX SoCs:",
      "source_hash": 4289662848241166298,
      "context_hash": 1547388805359732983,
      "translation": "이 디렉터리에는 LiteX SoC용 라이브러리와 소프트웨어 패키지가 들어 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:31.785523Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "[DemoBundle](DemoBundle/): a ROM with several demo programs, to measure the speed of softcores (raystones), to draw shiny spheres with raytracing (tinyraytracer), to display animations on the small OLED screen (riscv-logo, julia) ...",
      "source_hash": 12891658677115857589,
      "context_hash": 1976379894378918146,
      "translation": "[DemoBundle](DemoBundle/): 소프트코어의 속도를 측정하고(raystones), 레이트레이싱으로 반짝이는 구체를 그리고(tinyraytracer), 작은 OLED 화면에 애니메이션을 표시하는(riscv-logo, julia) 등 여러 데모 프로그램이 담긴 ROM입니다 ...",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:31.785523Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "[LiteOS](LiteOS/): a minimalistic OS that lets you load and execute programs (ELF binaries) stored on the SDCard;",
      "source_hash": 1670723753219256636,
      "context_hash": 6087373130219593851,
      "translation": "[LiteOS](LiteOS/): SD 카드에 저장된 프로그램(ELF 바이너리)을 불러와 실행할 수 있게 해주는 최소화된 OS입니다;",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:31.785523Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "[Programs](Programs/): simple example programs for LiteOS",
      "source_hash": 1582304686871631894,
      "context_hash": 15822403666523324576,
      "translation": "[Programs](Programs/): LiteOS용 간단한 예제 프로그램들입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:31.785524Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "[Doom](Doom/): a port of Doom for LiteOS",
      "source_hash": 11838962562608989397,
      "context_hash": 4720898837043814706,
      "translation": "[Doom](Doom/): LiteOS용으로 포팅된 Doom입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:31.785524Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "[Tagl](Tagl/): a 3D software renderer (that I wrote in the 90s) ported to LiteOS",
      "source_hash": 17195543161712642881,
      "context_hash": 13846861285739413193,
      "translation": "[Tagl](Tagl/): (제가 90년대에 작성한) 3D 소프트웨어 렌더러를 LiteOS로 포팅한 것입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:31.785524Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "[Libs](Libs/): common libraries (ELF support, OLED screen, framebuffer, Dear ImGui port, stdio adapter)",
